older version, viz. AS200_V5_8.EXE which contained SRM v6.3-4, and
fortunately the flash ROMs took that.  So, I conclude v7.0-9 uses more of
the ROMs than 6.3-4, including some bits which are faulty; and that the
circuitry which interfaces to them is OK.  Maybe I'll try replacing one or
both of those chips.

